  "status": "accepted",
  "summary": "Product knowledge and completion receipts hold durable outcomes; shared current rows support resumption with expected-version and idempotency checks. Main obtains independent native Task Review and records typed subject-bound outcomes. Concord has no subagent launcher, execution lifecycle or producer-identity attestation. Verify retains native receipts, exact preparation bundles and subject/environment checks. Stage exits, dependency invalidation, proof, approvals, delivery, publication and required CI remain. Verified-snapshot retirement preserves active work and truthful historical absence. Generated contracts have one source.",
